      "plain_text": "Validation decision: SYNTHESIZED, not ACTIVE. Confidence remains Medium because the proposed architecture is a derived design principle. The boundary pass now additionally covers MarTech as a cross-functional technology/IT layer and nonprofit/transformative marketing as contextual/paradigmatic dimensions, while remaining subfield and methodology gaps prevent promotion to ACTIVE.",
      "href": null
     }
